 *******************************************************************************
 *  CALCULATION DONE: (MAX THREADS = 2)              Mon Sep  7 09:06:03 2026  *
 *  PM7        - The PM7 Hamiltonian to be used
 *  GEO-OK     - OVERRIDE INTERATOMIC DISTANCE AND OTHER SAFETY CHECKS
 *
 *
 *
 *                 CHARGE ON SYSTEM = +2
 *
 *
 *
 *
 *  EXTERNAL=n -  DEFAULT PARAMETERS RESET USING DATA IN FILES: 
 *                 "eu_fix.txt"
 *  LET        - OVERRIDE SOME SAFETY CHECKS
 *  EF         - USE EF ROUTINE FOR MINIMUM SEARCH
 *  THREADS    - USE UP TO 2 THREADS
 *  T=         - A TIME OF 3.0 DAYS REQUESTED
 *  DUMP=N     - RESTART FILE WRITTEN EVERY 30.0 MINUTES REQUESTED
 *  CYCLES=    - DO A MAXIMUM OF 3000 STEPS
 *  GNORM      - EXIT WHEN GRADIENT NORM DROPS BELOW 1.000
 *  AUX        - OUTPUT AUXILIARY INFORMATION
 *  BONDS      - FINAL BOND-ORDER MATRIX TO BE PRINTED
 *******************************************************************************
PM7 CHARGE=2 AUX GNORM=1.0 CYCLES=3000 THREADS=2 GEO-OK T=3D DUMP=30M BONDS EF LET EXTERNAL=eu_fix.txt
 PM7_CTRL_acetate_bid Eu + acetate + 9 H2O q=2

